{"cuisine/iron-range-cuisine":{"t":"cuisine","r":"cuisine/iron-range-cuisine","n":"Iron Range cuisine","c":"#94bd5c","crumb":[["The Americas","cuisines#the-americas"],["Minnesotan cuisine","cuisine/minnesotan-cuisine"]],"sub":"Regional cuisine in United States of America","intro":[["Iron Range cuisine refers to the cooking traditions and dishes of the Iron Range of Minnesota. Iron Range cuisine is based on Canadian, German, Italian, Cornish, Scandinavian, and Slovenian cuisine. Many of the dishes were brought by immigrants. Other dishes were invented by the iron mine workers because they needed nourishing foods that they could bring on the go. Many of the dishes of the Iron Range lost their association with their national origin."],["Iron Range foodways are distinct from the rest of Minnesota."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"iron-range-cuisine"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iron_Range_cuisine"}],"sections":[{"h":"Recipe sites","empty":"None yet","tryLinks":[["Minnesotan cuisine","cuisine/minnesotan-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Cookbooks","count":2,"rows":[{"name":"Come, You Taste: Family Recipes from the Iron Range","ref":"cookbook/come-you-taste-family-recipes-from-the-iron-range","color":"#f0b340","shape":"book","sub":"B. J. Carpenter, 2015","note":"Immigrant family recipes from Minnesota's Iron Range, published by the Minnesota Historical Society Press.","url":"https://shop.mnhs.org/products/come-you-taste","suggested":true},{"name":"End of the Road Cookbook: Traditional Favorites from the Iron Range","ref":"cookbook/end-of-the-road-cookbook-traditional-favorites-from-the-iron-range","color":"#f0b340","shape":"book","sub":"Crystal Schlueter","note":"Traditional Iron Range dishes such as porketta, potica, and pasties.","url":"https://shop.mnhs.org/products/end-of-the-road-cookbook-traditional-favorites-from-the-iron-range","suggested":true}]},{"h":"Part of","links":[["Minnesotan cuisine","cuisine/minnesotan-cuisine"]]}],"cont":"